{"id": "16-1899-2-2", "zh": "以 rudhi 为首的词根类", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-1900-2-8", "zh": "此后我将讲说以 rudhi 为首的各词根类；", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1901-2-8", "zh": "为了利益教法，就这六种词根类加以讲述。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-1902-2-4", "zh": "rudhi，义为遮止。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1902-5-9", "zh": "rudhi 这个词根用于遮止的意思。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1902-10-25", "zh": "这里所说的遮止，指覆盖、包围、阻碍，或者不让带走，这些都可以。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1902-26-35", "zh": "rundhati、rundhiti、rundhīti、rundheti、avarundheti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1902-36-41", "zh": "被动语态：道路被人阻断（maggo purisena rundhiyati）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1902-42-55", "zh": "rodho、orodho、virodho、paṭivirodho、viruddho、paṭiviruddho、pariruddho。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1902-56-59", "zh": "rundhituṃ、parirundhituṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1902-60-61", "zh": "rundhitvā。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1902-62-63", "zh": "parirundhitvā。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1903-2-6", "zh": "其中，**rodho** 是指监狱。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1903-7-18", "zh": "因为它阻止被关进去的、造了残暴恶业的众生的行动，遮断他们的去路，所以称为 **rodho**。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1903-19-31", "zh": "**orodho** 是指国王的后妃；她因为不被允许随心所欲地行动而受到约束、限制，所以叫作 orodho。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1903-32-35", "zh": "**virodho** 是指不相顺、相违。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1903-36-40", "zh": "**paṭivirodho** 是指一再地不相顺。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1903-41-45", "zh": "**viruddho** 是指陷入对立的人。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1903-46-52", "zh": "**paṭiviruddho** 是指以敌对者的身份陷入对立的人。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1903-53-57", "zh": "**pariruddho** 是指为了捉拿而被四面包围的人。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1903-58-71", "zh": "正如所说：“就像被敌人包围，虽然路上还有可走的去处。”", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "16-1903-72-75", "zh": "**avaruddho** 是指被驱逐的人。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1904-2-4", "zh": "muca，义为解脱、释放。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1904-5-8", "zh": "把鹿从束缚中放开（migaṃ bandhanā muñcati）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1904-9-12", "zh": "muñcanaṃ、mocanaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1904-13-16", "zh": "dukkhappamocanaṃ（从苦中解脱）、moco。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1905-2-6", "zh": "这里的 **moco** 是指有籽的芭蕉树。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1905-7-8", "zh": "muñcituṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1905-9-10", "zh": "muñcitvā。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1905-11-22", "zh": "使役形有“moceti、mocetuṃ、mocetvā”等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1906-2-4", "zh": "rica，义为排出、泻下。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1906-5-6", "zh": "riñcati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1906-7-14", "zh": "riñcanaṃ、virecanaṃ、vireko、virecako。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1906-15-16", "zh": "riñcituṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1906-17-18", "zh": "riñcitvā。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1907-2-4", "zh": "sica，义为流注、浇洒。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1907-5-8", "zh": "用水浇地（udakena bhūmiṃ siñcati）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1907-9-12", "zh": "为儿子灌顶，立他为王（puttaṃ rajje abhisiñci）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1907-13-14", "zh": "abhiseko（灌顶）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1907-15-17", "zh": "受过灌顶的刹帝利（muddhābhisitto khattiyo）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1907-18-26", "zh": "比丘，舀干这条船吧，舀空了，它就会轻快地行驶。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1907-27-28", "zh": "sittaṭṭhānaṃ（浇洒过的地方）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1907-29-30", "zh": "siñcituṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1907-31-32", "zh": "siñcitvā。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1908-2-4", "zh": "yuja，义为结合、致力。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1908-5-8", "zh": "yuñjati、anuyuñjati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1908-9-17", "zh": "被动语态有“yuñjiyati”等形式。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1908-18-26", "zh": "有些人认为应作“yuñjate”。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1908-27-40", "zh": "yuñjanaṃ、saṃyogo、anuyogo、bhāvanānuyutto、saññogo、saññojanaṃ、atthayojanā。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1908-41-44", "zh": "对疲倦的人来说，一由旬也是漫长的（dīghaṃ santassa yojanaṃ）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1908-45-48", "zh": "yuñjituṃ、anuyuñjituṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1908-49-50", "zh": "anuyuñjitvā。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1908-51-52", "zh": "yojeti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1908-53-58", "zh": "其中，saṃyojana 是指束缚，也就是欲贪等。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1908-59-61", "zh": "所谓 yojana（由旬），是这样的——", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1909-2-8", "zh": "十二指宽为一张手（vidatthi），两张手算作一肘（ratana）；", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1910-2-7", "zh": "七肘为一竿（yaṭṭhi），二十竿为一牛吼（usabha）；", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1911-2-7", "zh": "八十牛吼为一伽乌它（gāvuta），四伽乌它为一由旬。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1912-2-4", "zh": "bhuja，义为保护与食用。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1912-5-7", "zh": "pālana 就是守护。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1912-8-10", "zh": "byavaharaṇa 就是吞食。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1912-11-16", "zh": "bhuñjati、paribhuñjati、saṃbhuñjati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1912-17-19", "zh": "像奴仆那样受用了（dāsaparibhogena paribhuñji）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-1912-20-29", "zh": "使役形有“bhojeti、bhojayati”等形式。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1912-30-42", "zh": "bhojanaṃ、sambhogo、mahibhujo（国王）、gāmabhojako（村长）、upabhogo、paribhogo。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1912-43-46", "zh": "饭已被您吃了（bhutto odano bhavatā）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1912-47-50", "zh": "如果我已经吃过了（sace bhutto bhaveyyāhaṃ）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1912-51-55", "zh": "吃过饭的人：bhutto、bhuttavā、bhuttāvī。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1912-56-88", "zh": "在以 tuṃ 结尾等形式中，有“bhuñjituṃ、paribhuñjituṃ、bhojetuṃ、bhojayituṃ、bhuñjitvā、bhuñjitvāna、bhuñjiya、bhuñjiyāna、bhojetvā、bhojetvāna、bhojayitvā、bhojayitvāna”等，这些都应当用 pari 等前缀加以区别。", "confidence": 70}
